/**
 * Bahasa Indonesia: the sentences.
 *
 * The prose half of the dictionary: explanations, refusals, Design Doctor
 * findings, tolerance verdicts, the engineering notes, the text written into a
 * release package. Anything the application says rather than labels.
 *
 * Split from lang-interface.js only so that neither file grows past the point
 * where it is reviewable; `t()` sees one table.
 */
